WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:02.660 --> 00:09.220
So what is synthesis, and why is it so important,
particularly at the end of problem-solving efforts?

2
00:09.860 --> 00:18.020
Synthesis is taking everything you've done as part of
the problem-solving process and getting to the “so what”.

3
00:18.790 --> 00:21.890
Why does this matter to me, or to the organisation?

4
00:23.010 --> 00:28.900
Often we see, particularly at the end
of large, complex, long projects,

5
00:29.410 --> 00:40.550
so much analysis has been done that there is a desire — a bias —
to share all the data and information, to show how much work was done.

6
00:41.350 --> 00:46.218
What you really want to do at this stage
is to stop and think:

7
00:46.218 --> 00:49.280
what is the “so what” from all of this?

8
00:50.570 --> 00:56.770
Absolutely critical. And why does it matter?
Then focus on that synthesis.

9
00:57.350 --> 01:02.790
Now, it's important to understand there's a difference
between summary and synthesis.

10
01:03.330 --> 01:08.480
A summary is often a more concise version
of the facts of that analysis.

11
01:09.000 --> 01:15.330
The synthesis, though, is at a higher level:
it is thinking about what the takeaway is —

12
01:16.200 --> 01:20.770
what to do with it, and what the “so what”
from that analysis is.

13
01:21.290 --> 01:26.880
Let me give you an example. The other day,
my brother and I were planning to meet for dinner.

14
01:27.370 --> 01:33.950
As I sat in the restaurant waiting for him, I got a very long
text message. He told me his meeting ran late,

15
01:34.340 --> 01:40.100
he forgot his phone at the office and had to go back for it,
and he just missed the train.

16
01:40.520 --> 01:43.620
That was a pretty good summary
of the events that had occurred to him.

17
01:44.040 --> 01:47.300
What is the synthesis?
“I'm going to be late for dinner.”

18
01:48.070 --> 01:56.130
So as you think about summary versus synthesis:
the synthesis is the insight we are getting to,

19
01:56.840 --> 02:04.030
whereas the summary is the concise re-articulation
of all the facts that support that synthesis.
